  "id": "restless-legs-syndrome",
  "term": "restless-legs syndrome",
  "definition": "Restless-legs syndrome is a disorder in which aching or burning feelings, usually in the legs and less often in the arms, happen before sleep or wake a person from sleep. It is defined by these uncomfortable sensations occurring around sleep.",
